WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.970 --> 00:00:12.470
I served from October 1982 to November 2002.

00:00:12.470 --> 00:00:15.280
I served from 2005 to 2009.

00:00:15.280 --> 00:00:18.790
From June 2010 to December 2013.

00:00:18.790 --> 00:00:21.540
I served from 1989 until 2011.

00:00:21.540 --> 00:00:25.790
I served from 1991 to today, and I will always
remember my oath.

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:26.911
I will always remember my oath.

00:00:26.911 --> 00:00:28.930
I will always remember my oath, always remember
my oath.

00:00:28.930 --> 00:00:32.470
I will always remember my oath.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:45.900
I, Jon Lewis, I, Mike Harner, I, Hannah Zeiser,
I, Michael Murray, I, Bruce Leon Wykes do

00:00:45.910 --> 00:00:50.620
solemnly swear that I will support and defend,
that I will support and defend the Constitution

00:00:50.620 --> 00:00:55.910
of the United States against all enemies,
foreign and domestic; that I will bear true

00:00:55.910 --> 00:01:01.350
faith and allegiance to the same; that I take
this obligation freely, and without mental

00:01:01.350 --> 00:01:05.830
reservation or purpose of evasion, and that
I will obey the orders of the President of

00:01:05.830 --> 00:01:12.000
the United States and the orders of the officers
appointed over me, according to regulations

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:14.580
and the Uniform Code of the Military Justice.

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:19.740
And that I will well and faithfully discharge
the duties of the office on which I am about

00:01:19.740 --> 00:01:22.850
to enter, duties of the office on which I
am about to enter.

00:01:22.850 --> 00:01:23.860
So help me God.

00:01:23.860 --> 00:01:25.190
So help me God.

00:01:25.190 --> 00:01:26.280
So help me God.

00:01:26.280 --> 00:01:27.720
So help me God.

00:01:27.720 --> 00:01:29.480
So help me God.

